I wouuld only check to be sure that it didn't turn to be a factor (which depends on how you got the excel file into R), since if you'd use "as.numeric" on a factor variable with the content you describe it would not work properly.

Probably using something like:
sum( as.numeric(as.character(x[["speed"]])) , na.rm = TRUE)
Will be safer...

